Business Insights:
- High-performing products generated the majority of revenue.
- Some categories achieved high sales but lower profit margins.
- Regional performance varied, highlighting opportunities for targeted growth.
- Sales trends revealed seasonal patterns useful for planning.

Business Recommendations:
- Focus marketing on high-performing products.
- Improve profitability in low-margin categories.
- Invest in high-performing regions.
- Use sales trends to support inventory and promotional planning.
